  STUDENT PAL WIDGET — ROOT BACKGROUND
  =====================================
  EDIT THESE PROPERTIES:

  BACKGROUND COLOR:  change the #RRGGBB value in <solid android:color="..."/>
                     Format: #AARRGGBB (AA = alpha hex, e.g. CC = 80% opacity)
  CORNER RADIUS:     change the android:radius value (currently 12dp)
